ions-item" id="author-information">Author information</h2><div class="c-article-section__content" id="author-information-content"><span class="c-article-author-information__subtitle u-visually-hidden" id="author-notes">Author notes</span><ol class="c-article-author-information__list"><li class="c-article-author-information__item" id="na1"><p>These authors contributed equally: Peter A. Szabo, Hanna Mendes Levitin.</p></li><li class="c-article-author-information__item" id="na2"><p>These authors jointly supervised this work: Donna L. Farber, Peter A. Sims.</p></li></ol><h3 class="c-article__sub-heading" id="affiliations">Authors and Affiliations</h3><ol class="c-article-author-affiliation__list"><li id="Aff1"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Columbia Center for Translational Immunology, Columbia University Irving Medical Center, New York, NY, USA</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Peter A. Szabo, Michelle Miron, Mark E. Snyder, Takashi Senda, Pranay Dogra, Puspa Thapa &amp; Donna L. Farber</p></li><li id="Aff2"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Department of Systems Biology, Columbia University Irving Medical Center, New York, NY, USA</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Hanna Mendes Levitin, Jinzhou Yuan, Yim Ling Cheng, Erin C. Bush &amp; Peter A. Sims</p></li><li id="Aff3"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Department of Microbiology and Immunology, Columbia University Irving Medical Center, New York, NY, USA</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Michelle Miron &amp; Donna L. Farber</p></li><li id="Aff4"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Department of Surgery, Columbia University Irving Medical Center, New York, NY, USA</p><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__authors-list">Takashi Senda &amp; Donna L. Farber</p></li><li id="Aff5"><p class="c-article-author-affiliation__address">Department of Biochemistry and Molecular Biophysics, Columbia Unive