    <section data-title="Comments" data-nosnippet="true">
        <div class="c-article-section" id="article-comments-section">
            <h2 class="c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item" id="article-comments">Comments</h2>
            <div class="c-article-section__content" id="article-comments-content">
                <p class="c-article-section__content-banner">Commenting on this article is now closed.</p>
                <ol class="u-list-reset c-article-comments-list">
                    
                        <li id="comment-6434306059" class="c-article-comments-list__item">
                            
                                <p class="c-article-comments-list__submitted"><span class="c-article-comments-list__author">Yewann Leong</span> <time datetime="2024-04-12T06:58:35Z" class="c-article-comments-list__date">12 April 2024, 06:58</time></p>
                            
                            <p>Hi, the cluster number is wrong in supplementary data 4 and 5. In the spreadsheet, the FOXP3 Treg cluster appears to be cluster 11 for donor 1 while cluster 7 for donor 2, while in the figure it is cluster 7 for donor 1 and cluster 6 for donor 2. Can the authors please rectify this and upload the correct files? Thank you.</p>
                        </li>
                    
                </ol>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

                    
